; Institutional Blxck Mirror - single universal preset
; Works for GBPUSD and EURUSD alike: the significance filters are ATR-relative,
; so they self-scale to each pair's range. Pip-based values are middle-ground.
; IMPORTANT: verify InpServerToNYOffset against YOUR broker's server clock first.
; Mirrors the EA's built-in defaults exactly - a restore point, not required.
